---
title: "deposit (Current Finance - Pebble Protocol Lending)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: app.ensure_version_matches()
    q_validate --> q_check_market: app.validate_market(market)
    q_check_market --> q_check_circuit: assert(!market.has_circuit_break_triggered())
    q_check_circuit --> q_error: circuit break triggered
    q_check_circuit --> q_timestamp: now = clock.timestamp_ms() / 1000
    q_timestamp --> q_capture: deposit_amount = coin.value()
    q_capture --> q_mint: market.handle_mint(obligation_id, coin, now)
    q_mint --> q_update_miner: miner.update_obligation_reward_manager(deposit_type, obligation_id, total_ctoken_amount, clock)
    q_update_miner --> q_emit: emit DepositEvent
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    note right of q_mint
        INV-001: ctoken_amount = deposit_amount / exchange_rate
        INV-002: exchange_rate = (cash + borrows - reserves) / total_supply
        INV-003: total_ctoken_amount reflects post-deposit balance for obligation
    end note

    note right of q_update_miner
        INV-004: Liquidity mining rewards updated atomically with deposit
        INV-005: Cannot deposit asset that is already borrowed by same obligation
    end note
